# Always push to GitHub

This is a standing order. The user will not repeat it.

After every completed set of code or design changes in this repo:

1. Create a git commit.
2. Push to `origin` (`https://github.com/meklads/scentswave`) immediately.
3. Do this without being asked, reminded, or told "ارفع" / "push".

Never wait for permission to commit or push finished work on this project.

Do not push secrets, `.env` files, or unrelated files.
